<title>USA: GulfMark Offshore Q1 continuing net rises.</title>
<headline>GulfMark Offshore Q1 continuing net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>Earnings per share from continuing operations</p>
<p>	     profit$0.16	 profit   $0.03</p>
