<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  GulfMark Offshore Inc said its net income for the first quarter of 1997 includes the loss on the disposal of GulfMark International Inc in April 1997 of $1,426,000, or $0.21 per share, net of taxes.</p>
<p>Per share amounts have been restated to reflect the distribution of two shares of GulfMark Offshore Inc for each share of GulfMark International Inc.</p>
